  "post_title": "Jornada informativa de la FP dual a las empresas en el IES Serra d'Espadà",
  "post_date": "2013-11-27 22:01:33",
  "post_name": "jornada-informativa-de-la-fp-dual-a-las-empresas-en-el-ies-serra-despada",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Educación|Empleo|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>El sal&oacute;n de actos del IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;, en Onda, ha acogido la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles una jornada informativa a las empresas sobre la FP dual, que se ha implantado este curso en el m&oacute;dulo de Cer&aacute;mica del centro.</p>\n<p>Ante un buen n&uacute;mero de representantes del empresariado y el profesorado, han inaugurado la jornada el director del IES, Santiago Sagasta, el alcalde de Onda, Salvador Aguilella Ramos, y el general de FP de la Generalitat, Gonzalo Alabau Zabal. Tambi&eacute;n ha asistido&nbsp;la subdirectora general, Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Jorge, la&nbsp;teniente de alcalde&nbsp;de Cultura y Educaci&oacute;n, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu Garc&iacute;a, as&iacute; como una amplia representaci&oacute;n de la Corporaci&oacute;n Municipal.</p>\n<p>El director general de la Conselleria d&#39;Educaci&oacute; ha explicado las lineas generales de la FP dual, en la cual el alumnado sigue una parte del curso en pr&aacute;cticas remuneradas en la empresa, bien directamente o a trav&eacute;s de una becas de Bankia.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_3383.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Manuel Collado, director del departamento de Cer&aacute;mica del IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; ha expuesto c&oacute;mo se concreta la FP dual en este m&oacute;dulo del centro.</p>\n<p>A continuaci&oacute;n ha habido un debate en el que han intervenido tambi&eacute;n el director de Formaci&oacute;n y Empleo de la C&aacute;mara de Comercio, Javier Valls, y el director de Relaciones Laborales y Formaci&oacute;n de ASCER, Germ&aacute;n Belbis.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3353.jpg\" alt=\"img_3353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3354.jpg\" alt=\"img_3354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3355.jpg\" alt=\"img_3355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3357.jpg\" alt=\"img_3357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3358.jpg\" alt=\"img_3358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3359.jpg\" alt=\"img_3359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3362.jpg\" alt=\"img_3362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3363.jpg\" alt=\"img_3363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3368.jpg\" alt=\"img_3368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3371.jpg\" alt=\"img_3371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3372.jpg\" alt=\"img_3372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3373.jpg\" alt=\"img_3373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3374.jpg\" alt=\"img_3374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3375.jpg\" alt=\"img_3375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3376.jpg\" alt=\"img_3376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3377.jpg\" alt=\"img_3377\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3378.jpg\" alt=\"img_3378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3380.jpg\" alt=\"img_3380\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3381.jpg\" alt=\"img_3381\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3383.jpg\" alt=\"img_3383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3384.jpg\" alt=\"img_3384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadafpdualiesserraespada/img_3385.jpg\" alt=\"img_3385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
